    - target: {fileID: 6524945628722089889, guid: 4d45bc5068ba5a44588a0f05f1d3c480,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "Step into the role of a fearless robot explorer on the rugged Martian
        surface! Your mission is to navigate treacherous alien terrain, battling
        hostile enemies and overcoming obstacles to reach your ultimate goal. Each
        level pushes you deeper into Mars, where danger grows and new challenges
        await.\n\nAlong the way, collect points, health bars, and extra lives to
        keep your robot strong and ready for battle. Search for keys hidden across
        the landscape\u2014use them to unlock doors that block your path to the goal.
        Defeat enemies by jumping directly on their heads, gather resources to survive,
        and push forward through each stage.\n\nOnce the goal is achieved, you advance
        to the next level with tougher enemies, trickier puzzles, and greater rewards.\n\nControls:\n\nW,
        A, S, D \u2013 Move your robot forward, backward, left, and right\n\nSpacebar
        \u2013 Jump to overcome obstacles or land on enemy heads to eliminate them\n\nMouse
        Movement \u2013 Control your view and explore the Martian landscape\n\nStay
        alert, master your movements, collect the keys, and conquer Mars one level
        at a time!\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nCreated by - Raviraj
        Panchal (CORA Games)\nMichigan State University - Game Design and Development"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6524945628722089889, guid: 4d45bc5068ba5a44588a0f05f1d3c480,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_fontSize
